+The “Linked Discourses with Anuruddha” contains 24 discourses with Anuruddha, famous for his powers of clairvoyance, but here revealed as an exponent of the establishment of mindfulness. It is to the establishment of mindfulness that he attributes his spiritual attainments, whether psychic powers, jhānas, or awakening. This series of texts can be regarded as a supplement to SN 47.
